Syrin is a rotting ghoul in a bellhop's uniform who serves as the footman of [[Nos Mortem]]. He answers the bell in the manor's lounge, reeking, and asks what is wanted.

He brought the Party a decorative shield taken off one of the walls and a platter of pigs in blankets, and refused to open a window for them when they asked.
